            {
              "type": "statichtml",
              "inputClass": "col-md-6",
              "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">I know this is an unexpected call, but I came across you and your company and thought I would reach out.&nbsp;</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Do you mind if I take 30 seconds to explain why I&rsquo;m reaching out to you? Then you can decide if it&rsquo;s worth continuing the conversation?</span></p>",
