                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<p>Or ...</p>\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6711%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We&rsquo;ve been helping our customers make things easier by letting their teams quote and estimate right in the customer's home. It&rsquo;s made a real difference, boosting close rates and speeding up their sales process. It&rsquo;s all about getting the job done faster and more efficiently.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
