                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6711%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Just so nobody from my team bugs you again is it that I caught you at a horrible time or that you already know what we do and that it's not a current priority for you?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
