                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "groupClass": "col-md-12",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6711%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>I appreciate you being upfront. I don't really love making these calls and I'm sure you're not a fan either.  I did my research and this isn't just a random call. Could I take 30 seconds to share what we found and then you can totally hang up on me if it's not relevant? I promise I'll be brief.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
