                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.854%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Oh... Well the reason I ask is because most $value -case(property'coldcall:Prospect Job Title')$s are frustrated when they find out they can create estimates and workflows for their specific sales flow and turn the admin time back into sales time.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>",
