                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Just so that no one calls again, is it that there's no budget for this cycle or that any spend requires you to do backflips?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
