                {
                  "label": "Yes - Provide Pitch",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Has 30 Seconds",
                  "autoValue": "Yes",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-9",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6711%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16pt;\"><b>What we do</b><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We've been helping businesses automate customer service for over 25 years, and we've recently developed a tool specifically for field service management. It automates scheduling, dispatching, estimating, quoting, and customer communication in one easy-to-use system.</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html112",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-12",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6711%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16pt;\"><strong>My ask</strong><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Right now, we're offering an opportunity for a few select companies to try it at a reduced cost. Would you be open to exploring when I am not calling you out of the blue?</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">As a thank-you for taking the time to explore it with us, we&rsquo;re offering a $50 Amazon gift card after a quick demo. It&rsquo;s just our way of showing appreciation for considering something new that could make an impact on your day-to-day.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html113",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-9",
                      "html": "<p>Or ...</p>\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6711%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">And I'm wondering if you might be open to learning more when I'm not calling you out of the blue?</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html114",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-9",
                      "html": "<p>Or ...</p>\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6711%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">My guess is you've probably got this covered, but I thought it might be worth sharing. If nothing else, it&rsquo;s good to know what options are out there, right?</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html115",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<p>Or ...</p>\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6711%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We&rsquo;ve been helping our customers make things easier by letting their teams quote and estimate right in the customer's home. It&rsquo;s made a real difference, boosting close rates and speeding up their sales process. It&rsquo;s all about getting the job done faster and more efficiently.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html116",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "No - Manage Objections",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Has 30 Seconds",
                  "autoValue": "No",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6711%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Just so nobody from my team bugs you again is it that I caught you at a horrible time or that you already know what we do and that it's not a current priority for you?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html117",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "groupClass": "col-md-12",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6711%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>I appreciate you being upfront. I don't really love making these calls and I'm sure you're not a fan either.  I did my research and this isn't just a random call. Could I take 30 seconds to share what we found and then you can totally hang up on me if it's not relevant? I promise I'll be brief.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
