                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"My bad. This kind of thing usually either lives with you as <strong>$value -case(property'Prospect Job Title')$ </strong>or <strong>$value -case(property'Co-worker Job Title')$</strong>. Guess I was wrong there.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
