                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.854%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>That's interesting. We've never been the cheapest but we're also not astronomically expensive.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
