                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.854%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Oh... well, other <strong>$value -case(property'Prospect Job Title')$s</strong> often found that [problem statement]. And we help with that</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
