                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6528%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"Yeah, I wouldn't want to make any big decisions before then either.\"</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html140",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6528%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"I know you're not gonna buy this now, but oftentimes knowing what's out there can be a benefit to <strong>[time-based objection]</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html141",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "    ",
                      "htmlID": "html142",
                      "editorStyle": "raw"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6528%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"If nothing else would you be opposed to taking a look so that you can have a sense of options?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html143",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "Where'd you get my number?",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "Where'd you get my number?",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>It's a contact database called ZoomInfo.  It sounds like I really ruined your day here, so I'd be happy to send you a screenshot of what they have on file so you know what's out there.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html144",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>I know you weren't expecting me to call. But I put some time into preparing to speak to you.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html145",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Just so no one calls you again, could I tell you why I called you specifically, then you can tell me if makes sense if we should continue?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html146",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "I'm in a meeting",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "I'm in a meeting",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Oh no! Well, if you want you can put me on speaker to publicly apologized to the group, and I can really fall on the sword on this one.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html147",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>I'd hate to interupt you again. Would you rather have me send a hold to call you back at the top of the hour of briefly tell you why I called now so I don't bug ya again?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html148",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "I thought you were someone else",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "I thought you were someone else",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>I can pretend to be someone else if that helps.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html149",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>I hate it too when I'm waiting for a call, then I pick up and it's someone trying to sell me something.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html150",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Well, I'd hate to do this two you twice.   Could I just tell you why I called you, and I promise if that person calls you back you can hang up on the spot?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html151",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "We do it in-house",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "We do it in-house",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.854%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Oh wow! Ususally when that happens &nbsp;it means you're process experts.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html152",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 100%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Honestly, sounds like it's not really a pain. Just so no one else calls, that must mean customization for invoices, estimates, and reports is a breeze and the learning curve for the team was simple too, right?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html153",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.854%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Oh... Well the reason I ask is because most $value -case(property'coldcall:Prospect Job Title')$s are frustrated when they find out they can create estimates and workflows for their specific sales flow and turn the admin time back into sales time.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>",
                      "htmlID": "html154",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6528%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>You'll probably keep managing this yourself, but if nothing else, could I give you a sense of what it'd look like to consolidate the spend?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html155",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "Call me in X months",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "Call me in X months",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6528%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"Totally makes sense. I guess if you were ready now, you would've reached out to us.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html156",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6528%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"Just so I don't sound like an idiot when I call back, was there something specific happening in X months or are you just swamped?\"</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html157",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "Is this a cold call?",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "Is this a cold call?",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Yes, and it appears it's going poorly.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html158",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Look, I know you probably hate getting cold calls. I don't honestly love making them either, but I took some time to research you personally because everyone hates telemarketers.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html159",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Just so no one from my team interupts you again, could I tell you why I called, and, if nothing else, you can hang up on me if it's really not a fit?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html160",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "No Budget",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "No Budget",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.854%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>I hear ya. Nowadays, it's hard enough to keep the budget you have let alone add something new.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html161",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Just so that no one calls again, is it that there's no budget for this cycle or that any spend requires you to do backflips?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html162",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>I get it. You're probably not gonna buy right now.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html163",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.854%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>But if budget ever frees up, the folks who get it at least have a directional sense of what's on their wishlist.  Open to taking a look so you at least know what's out there?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html164",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "Need to hire someone",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "Need to hire someone",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>I hear you. No one wants to make big decicions that get unwound after personel changes.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html165",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>I'd hate bug you before the change happens. Is the search just getting started or have you folks set a start date?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html166",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Yeah, you're probably not going to buy this now. But oftentimes the new <strong>$value -case(property'coldcall:Prospect Job Title')$</strong> comes in with big ideas, and they'll wanna know what's at their disposal.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html167",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6528%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>So, would you be opposed to taking a look so you have list of things in your toolkit that you can share?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html168",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "Product Fit/ Not made for us",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "Product Fit/ Not made for us",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6528%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>That's surprising to hear. I can totally respect that you wouldn't even look at a tool if you weren't sure it'd work for your team.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html169",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>I'd hate to have someone reach out again if we're really not a good fit here. Was it something with our product, support, something else?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html170",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Look, I can tell you know your stuff, and I know I'm not gonna convince you on a cold call.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html171",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>We have several [descriptor] customers, and I'd be happy to make introductions if it made sense.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html172",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>But first, could I show you how we've helped other similar companies so you can see it with your own eyes.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html173",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "Competitor (known)",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "Competitor (known)",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6528%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Oh,&nbsp;<strong>[Competitor Name]</strong>&nbsp;They're a good fit for a lot of businesses.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html174",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 58.7812px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.6528%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 58.7812px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 58.7812px;\">Hey, just so we don't bug you again. That must mean cusomization for invoices, reports, and estimates is a breeze, and the learning curve for your team has been simple as well.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>",
                      "htmlID": "html175",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.854%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Oh... well, other&nbsp;<strong>$value -cas(property'Prospect Job Title')S</strong>&nbsp;often found that the ability to quote right in customer's living room can make or break a sale. And we help with that</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html176",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-6",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.854%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>My guess is you won't switch, but could I give you a sense of value statement, just so you know what's out there?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html177",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "Send me some info",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "Send me some info",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-3",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 98.6111%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"Oh, for sure. I'd wanna digest it all first too.\"</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html178",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"Just so I don't clutter your inbox, was there a specific question you had in mind or just a general overview?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html179",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"I'm the king of 'this meeting should have been an email' too. But I'll be honest, I don't know how useful those PDFs will be and you'll know if this is a fit in the first 15 minutes of a demo.   Opposed to taking a look and if it's not a fit I can give you 15 back?\"</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html180",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"Ok, waiving the white flag here! Before I go, mind if I ask you a brutally honest question?\"</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html181",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"When folks tell me to send them some info, they're just to nice to tell me to go away. Is that what's happening?\"</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html182",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-4",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.3548%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>\"Ok, here's our deal. I'll send yo the info, call out exactly what's relevant to you, and send a placeholder invite for next week. If you don't like what I send you can just decline the invite?</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html183",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "Who are you?",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "Who are you?",
                  "inputs": []
                },
                {
                  "label": "Voicemail",
                  "icon": "",
                  "autoType": "text=",
                  "autoProperty": "Cold Call Dispo",
                  "autoValue": "Voicemail",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "type": "statichtml",
                      "inputClass": "col-md-12",
                      "html": "<table border=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.854%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Hi <strong>$value -customer(firstname)$</strong>,&nbsp;<br><br>\n<p>This is Nick from one to one service<br><br>No need to call back, just wanted to give you a quick heads-up to keep an eye out for an email I just sent your way.<br><br>Thanks <strong>$value -customer(firstname)$, </strong>have a great day!</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
                      "htmlID": "html184",
                      "editorStyle": "editor"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "automaticTab": true,
              "autoBoxStyle": ""
            },
